atively weak play. With only 4 cards remaining and no combinations possible in my hand, I need to preserve the RedJoker for a more crucial moment - either to regain control when I\'m truly stuck or to guarantee winning my final plays. The peasants have 12 cards between them; letting them battle each other while I conserve my strongest asset is the wiser tactical choice.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
